Modifications: Rewritten in GDScript only and rechecked against the Godot 4.7 XR docs, class reference and ProjectSettings, and the OpenXR Vendors plugin 5.1.0. Fixed upstream errors: OpenXR is a core project setting, not a plugin; V-Sync is ignored under OpenXR (the advice to disable it was replaced with matching the physics tick rate to the headset); controller action names follow the engine's default action map (primary is a Vector2 thumbstick); the joint-based grab, which cannot work on a non-physics XRController3D, was replaced with a freeze-and-reparent grab; hand trackers use /user/hand_tracker/left|right; the fixed API-29 minimum and the Windows D3D12-default claim were dropped; foveation notes were reconciled with the 4.5+ Vulkan support. Added session events, refresh-rate handling, snap turn, the pointer-to-SubViewport input mapping, frame synthesis, Quest export steps and a version table.
